# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Railway source data. Local-only, never committed — here or in the web repo
# (Japan-Train-Map), where the builders live.
#
# Official GIS/CSV/GTFS downloads (MLIT N02, data.go.kr, FRA/BTS NARN, the
# state and operator publications behind us-2025/ca-2025), OpenStreetMap
# extracts, and Apple Maps captures are not ours to redistribute: the
# publications carry their own attribution and use terms, OSM is ODbL, and the
# captures are Apple's imagery. What this repository ships is the processed
# output in app/public/rail/ and app/data/, with per-source provenance recorded
# in app/public/rail/*.sources.md.
#
# The North America fetchers in app/scripts/railway/ take an explicit
# --output-dir. Point it outside the repository; the documented example is
# /private/tmp/na-rail/gtfs.
#
# Never commit raw data, normalized extracts, screenshots, or coordinate-bearing
# reports from these trees.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
app/data/raw/
.local/railway-reference-only/

# Source GIS formats, wherever they land.
*.osm
*.osm.pbf
*.osm.xml
*.shp
*.shx
*.dbf
*.prj
*.cpg
*.gpkg
